      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Light rays form an enormous fist the size of a mountain, appear and vanish almost at once, and strike an unseen membrane over the blessed land. The hit pierces that barrier, shakes the blessed land, and opens a huge passage to the outside world. The sky dims while the move runs.",
